{"id":"torrey:denial-of-christ","source":"torrey","name":"Denial Of Christ","slug":"denial-of-christ","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"In doctrine — Mr 8:38; 2Ti 1:8.","refs":[["Mark",8,38,8,38],["2Tim",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"In practice — Php 3:18,10; Tit 1:16.","refs":[["Phil",3,18,3,18],["Phil",3,10,3,10],["Titus",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"A characteristic of false teachers — 2Pe 2:1; Jude 1:4.","refs":[["2Pet",2,1,2,1],["Jude",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Is the spirit of Antichrist — 1Jo 2:22,23; 4:3.","refs":[["1John",2,22,2,22],["1John",2,23,2,23],["1John",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Christ will deny those guilty of — Mt 10:33; 2Ti 2:12.","refs":[["Matt",10,33,10,33],["2Tim",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Leads to destruction — 2Pe 2:1; Jude 1:4,15.","refs":[["2Pet",2,1,2,1],["Jude",1,4,1,4],["Jude",1,15,1,15]]},{"text":"Peter. — Mt 26:69-75.","refs":[["Matt",26,69,26,75]]},{"text":"The Jews. — Joh 18:40; Ac 3:13,14.","refs":[["John",18,40,18,40],["Acts",3,13,3,13],["Acts",3,14,3,14]]}],"refCount":19}
